---
title: Request Flow — How Traffic Reaches Services
---
flowchart LR
    User([User / Slack / Webhook]) --> CF[Cloudflare DNS<br/>api.prodway.ai]
    CF --> ALB[ALB<br/>:80]
    
    ALB --> R1{Path?}
    R1 -->|/formpilot/*| TG2[FormPilot TG<br/>Health: /formpilot/health]
    R1 -->|everything else| TG1[SowFlow TG<br/>Health: /health]
    
    TG1 --> SF[SowFlow Container<br/>:3000]
    TG2 --> FP[FormPilot Container<br/>:3000]
    
    SF --> EFS[(EFS<br/>/app/data)]
    SF --> SM[(Secrets Manager<br/>14 keys)]
    SF --> AI1[Gemini / Claude]
    FP --> AI2[Gemini / Claude]
    FP -.->|validate API key| SF
    
    style User fill:#a855f7,color:#fff
    style ALB fill:#3b82f6,color:#fff
    style SF fill:#22c55e,color:#000
    style FP fill:#22c55e,color:#000
